        <div class="hero-inner">
            <p class="hero-kicker">Shuler Lab for Occupational Science and Hydrology</p>
            <h1>Science with communities for resilient Pacific watersheds.</h1>
            <p>
                We combine environmental engineering, geospatial analysis, and applied data tools to support
                climate adaptation, flood readiness, and equitable water decisions across Hawaii and the Pacific.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-primary" href="projects/">Explore Projects</a>
